 body again this video is  meant to inform  and support your journey not ever to  shame or belittle  anyone for their health and wellness  choices so  please help me keep the comment section  kind  and respectful now if you found this  information  enlightening please don't forget to give  this video a thumbs up  leave me a comment below if you have any  further questions about these types of  surgeries or really anything nutrition  related that you'd like a video on  subscribe to the channel don't forget  that and i will see you next time on  abby's kitchen  [Music]  bye  you
 

